    "text": "California voters will have a special election on Nov. 4 to decide if they’ll allow lawmakers to draw district lines and temporarily pause the state's independent commission. Scientist and political donor Charles Munger, who's trying to reform redistricting, explains why he's funding the No on Prop 50 Campaign.\nPolitical Donor Says California Prop 50 Redistricting Plan 'Harms the Nation'\nScientist and political donor Charles Munger, who's trying to reform redistricting, explains why he's funding the No on Prop 50 Campaign.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 10/8/2025, 11:53:07 PM EDT",
